التكرار: 10؛ المتبقي المخطط: 15؛ المتبقي الفعلي: 7', 'Stakeholders request an update on team progress across iterations. The project manager shares a burndown chart comparing actual remaining work with planned remaining work across ten iterations. After reviewing it, some stakeholders ask about project status at iteration nine. Based on the chart, what update should the project manager provide?
The horizontal axis represents iterations and the vertical axis represents units of remaining work. The following values are approximate readings from the chart.
